      {
        "id": 17521,
        "title": "Method pada Object",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148590,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Terkadang kita memiliki fungsi yang berkaitan erat dengan objek game kita. Misalnya, fungsi <code>jump()</code> yang berkaitan dengan objek <code>player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;player jumps!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jump();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>jump</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148591,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Serupa dengan properti, kita bisa mengelompokkan fungsi yang berkaitan ke dalam objek. Fungsi di dalam objek disebut <strong>method</strong> objek tersebut.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>jump : function() {}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148592,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita membuat method objek seperti properti, dimulai dengan nama dan titik dua <code>:</code>, diikuti kata kunci <code>function</code>, <code>()</code>, dan kurung kurawal <code>{}</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>function</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148593,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita memanggil metode-metode ini dengan nama objek, <code>.</code>, dan nama metode yang diikuti tanda kurung <code>()</code>, seperti <code>player.jump();</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;player jumps!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.jump();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>player</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>jump</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148594,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Method mirip dengan fungsi biasa. Artinya, kita juga bisa menyertakan parameter dan pernyataan <code>return</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"scoreMessage\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"points\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score +&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.scoreMessage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>function(points)</code>, diikuti oleh <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148595,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sebutan untuk fungsi di dalam sebuah objek?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Method-method objek</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi-fungsi objek</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Method-method objek.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148596,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rangkai kode untuk membuat method objek.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"62\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>attack</code>, diikuti oleh <code>:</code>, lalu <code>function</code>, <code>()</code>, <code>{}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148597,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara kita menyuruh objek <code>enemy</code> menjalankan method <code>attack</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime attacks!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>enemy.attack()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>enemy.attack</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>enemy.attack()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148598,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi keyword yang hilang untuk membuat sebuah method.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"60\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>function</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148599,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kata kunci apa yang kita gunakan untuk mendefinisikan method?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>function</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>method</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>function</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148600,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Susun kode untuk memanggil metode <code>attack</code> milik objek <code>enemy</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"call\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime attacks!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.attack();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>enemy</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>attack</code>, <code>()</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148601,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bisakah method menggunakan parameter dan pernyataan <code>return</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Ya.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148602,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan parameter yang hilang ke method tersebut.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Slime\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"player\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"takeDamage\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"damageAmount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Damage taken: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + damageAmount);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>damageAmount</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17522,
        "title": "Menggunakan Method",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148603,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari pelajari cara menggunakan method untuk mengakses dan memperbarui properti object.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.display();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>player.display();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148604,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kata kunci <code>this</code> merujuk pada objek yang berisi method tersebut. Dalam hal ini, <code>player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.display();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>this</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148605,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menggunakan <code>this</code> diikuti <code>.</code> untuk mendapatkan properti objek dari dalam method-nya.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.display();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>this</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148606,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Demikian pula, kita dapat menggunakan <code>this</code> yang diikuti <code>.</code> untuk memperbarui properti objek dari dalam method-nya.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"changeAndDisplay\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.changeAndDisplay();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>this.name</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, lalu <code>\"Knight\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148607,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Keyword <code>this</code> hanya dapat digunakan untuk mengakses properti suatu objek <strong>di dalam</strong> method objek tersebut.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"126\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"changeAndDisplay\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.changeAndDisplay();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>this</code>, diikuti oleh <code>this</code>, dan terakhir <code>player</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148608,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kata kunci apa yang bisa kita gunakan untuk merujuk ke objek yang berisi method tersebut?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>this</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>that</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>this</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148609,
            "contentType": "interactive",
